  "description": "Live at Dublin Docklands' most exclusive address \n***The Marker Residences ***\n\nUnique higher floor corner 2-bedroom apartment with River Liffey views and floor-to-ceiling windows throughout.\n\nStep inside and be greeted by a bright, open-plan living area with panoramic windows that flood the space with natural light. This exceptional apartment offers:\n\n- Two double bedrooms with River Liffey views and dedicated workdesks\n- Modern bathroom with premium finishes\n- Stunning open-plan kitchen and living area with BoConcept designer furniture\n- Brand new Bosch washer-dryer and dishwasher\n- 500 Mbps WiFi\n\nSituated at the heart of Silicon Docks, minutes from Google, Airbnb, TikTok, DocuSign, Indeed, Salesforce, HubSpot, JP Morgan and PwC. \n\nAs a resident at The Marker, you have direct access to the stunning FIVE STAR ANANTARA MARKER HOTEL SPA & GYM with discounted rates for residents.\n\nGrand Canal Dock DART station and Luas stops within walking distance. Grand Canal Square, Bord Gáis Energy Theatre, and some of Dublin's best restaurants and coffee shops on your doorstep.\n\nAvailable mid-September. Offered fully furnished to the highest standard. Viewing highly recommended.",
